{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994640/extras/14c538a73893a0864e46b8e1325744bf.avif?t=1758028813\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Erotic Clicker</strong> \u2013 Each click triggers smooth, looping animations created in Blender. The faster you click, the faster the action gets, with escalating visual effects and massive score multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Unique Levels</strong> \u2013 From the intimate <strong>Bedroom</strong> to the fiery depths of the <strong>Temple Below</strong>, each stage offers new challenges, ambience, and vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Challenges</strong> \u2013 You have limited time per stage to rack up points, earn stars, and climb the leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star Rewards</strong> \u2013 Earn Bronze, Silver, and Gold packs by filling stars during each level. Packs unlock characters and positions, but choosing when to buy is a risky gamble.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994640/extras/3fc055bf17b7d66d4e96c78eda505eba.poster.avif?t=1758028813\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994640/extras/3fc055bf17b7d66d4e96c78eda505eba.webm?t=1758028813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994640/extras/3fc055bf17b7d66d4e96c78eda505eba.mp4?t=1758028813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfa4 <strong>Collect &amp; Unlock</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong> \u2013 5 unique girls, each with multiple variations (Casual, Sexy, Naked, Costumes, Legendary skins, and ultra-rare Shiny versions).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positions &amp; Actions</strong> \u2013 Unlock 5 erotic actions, from classic <strong>Missionary</strong> to high-intensity <strong>Halfmoon</strong>. Rarities boost multipliers (from x1 to x5).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pack System</strong> \u2013 Spend points on Bronze, Silver, or Gold packs. The longer you wait, the cheaper they get; but after each purchase, prices double.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory System</strong> - Collect all your animations and replay them whenever you want.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994640/extras/c25f765e4704a7a403326c51a03019f3.poster.avif?t=1758028813\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994640/extras/c25f765e4704a7a403326c51a03019f3.webm?t=1758028813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994640/extras/c25f765e4704a7a403326c51a03019f3.mp4?t=1758028813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u26a1 <strong>Multiplier Madness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score is driven by stacking multipliers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Girl variant bonus</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Position bonus</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click speed bonus</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Example: S Annie (5x) + Doggy Style (2x) + Fast Clicking (3x) = <strong>30x total multiplier!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994640/extras/3c552c0c0024d765987d995b67717536.poster.avif?t=1758028813\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994640/extras/3c552c0c0024d765987d995b67717536.webm?t=1758028813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994640/extras/3c552c0c0024d765987d995b67717536.mp4?t=1758028813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Game Modes &amp; Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Campaign</strong> \u2013 Conquer 5 levels (Bedroom \u2192 Tropical Club \u2192 Beach \u2192 Temple Below \u2192 Mount Olympus).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus Level</strong> \u2013 Unlockable if you perfect all 5 levels: choose any map for one last high-score run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Grind your way to the top!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory System</strong> - Collect all your animations and replay them whenever you want.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994640/extras/bec5b43419fd61735ebf0b8b5f4e6053.poster.avif?t=1758028813\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994640/extras/bec5b43419fd61735ebf0b8b5f4e6053.webm?t=1758028813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s